  <data name="Act_AdminBody" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>You are currently running OMniX as administrator. This is not recommended.
OMniX is not designed to run with administrator privileges.
Even a small bug could mess up the file system, with serious consequences.

We recommend running OMniX with normal privileges.

Continue at your own risk.</value>
  </data>
