  <data name="Act_FreeBody1" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>OMniX is completely free and open source. It costs nothing, and there is no such thing as a "premium edition" or an "activation key".</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Act_FreeBody2" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>If anyone asks you for money before giving you the installer, or sells you an activation key or a premium edition, that person is scamming you. Just refuse them, and report it in the group chat or on GitHub so the next person does not get fooled.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Act_FreeBody3" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>There are only two legitimate ways to get it: the GitHub repository, and the group files in the community group chat. Please do not use anything downloaded from other sources.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Act_FreeTitle" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Free software — don't let anyone charge you</value>
  </data>
