  <data name="AutoUpd_Incomplete" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The updater folder is incomplete, missing {0}.
Most likely a previous incremental update corrupted the updater (the old logic left half a set of files).
Fix: download the latest full OMniX package from GitHub Releases, extract it, and overwrite the whole "OMniX - Auto Updater" folder in the program directory; then updating will work normally again.</value>
